From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: patrickjquinn <patrick.jm.quinn@gmail.com>
Date: Sun, 22 Nov 2026 23:00:00 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] arm64: dts: mediatek: mt6789: Fix the dither unit address

The dither block's registers are at 0x1400f000, as its reg says; the
node name gave the DSC's address, 0x14012000, so dtc warned about a
unit address that does not match reg and about two nodes at the same
address.

Signed-off-by: patrickjquinn <patrick.jm.quinn@gmail.com>
---
diff --git a/arch/arm64/boot/dts/mediatek/mt6789.dtsi b/arch/arm64/boot/dts/mediatek/mt6789.dtsi
--- a/arch/arm64/boot/dts/mediatek/mt6789.dtsi
+++ b/arch/arm64/boot/dts/mediatek/mt6789.dtsi
@@ -1214,7 +1214,7 @@
 			status = "disabled";
 		};
 
-		dither0: dither@14012000 {
+		dither0: dither@1400f000 {
 			compatible = "mediatek,mt6789-disp-dither";
 			reg = <0 0x1400f000 0 0x1000>;
 			interrupts = <GIC_SPI 297 IRQ_TYPE_LEVEL_HIGH &ppi_cluster0>;
-- 
2.47.0

